  placeholderImage: {fileID: 0}
  placeholderText: The last collar in the pack shatters. The freed lion shakes its
    head, looks back at Rook for a beat, then runs into the forest. In the distance,
    searchlights sweep over a fenced military base with a giant banner of the General's
    face. The alarm sounds, the gate opens and the soldiers march out.
